==Serbo-Croatian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|sh|štȁ}} (pronoun only)

===Etymology===
From {{inh|sh|sla-pro|*čьto||what}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|sh}} {{m|ine-pro|*kʷid}}, compare {{m|ine-pro|*kʷis}}; compare Čakavian {{m|sh|čȁ||what}} (from {{etyl|sla-pro|sh}} {{m|sla-pro|*čь}}).

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ʃtô/|lang=sh}}

===Adverb===
{{sh-adverb|head=štȍ}}

# [[why]] (short for {{m|sh|zȁšto}})
# {{lb|sh|in comparisons}} [[the]], [[as]]
#: {{ux|sh|'''što''' ranije to bolje|the sooner the better|inline=1}}
#: {{ux|sh|'''što''' brže|as quickly as possible|inline=1}}

===Pronoun===
{{sh-pronoun|head=štȍ}}

# {{lb|sh|interrogative}} [[what]]
